Ginkgo training table (optional / legacy)
=========================================

`ginkgo_training_with_coords.csv` is **not** covered by this repository's MIT
licence. It is a derived table that combines:

1. Occurrence coordinates compiled from GBIF (https://www.gbif.org/).
   Individual GBIF datasets use mixed licences (often CC BY or CC BY-NC).
   Users who republish coordinates should retrieve a GBIF download DOI and
   honour each contributing dataset's licence.

2. Bioclimatic covariates extracted from WorldClim 2.1
   (Fick & Hijmans 2017, *International Journal of Climatology*).
   WorldClim 2 is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Share-alike terms apply to that
   climate content; do not relicense the extracted values as MIT.

This file is provided only to reproduce historical spatial-CV experiments.
It is not required for the NCEAS analyses that support the main claims.
